<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github._99ecarvalho.linscp</id>
  <name>linscp</name>
  <summary>SFTP, SCP, FTP, WebDAV and S3 client</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github._99ecarvalho">
    <name>Eduardo Correia</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      linscp is a file manager for transferring files between your computer and
      remote servers, with a two-panel Commander interface and the same
      sessions, settings and scripting on Linux and Windows.
    </p>
    <p>
      It transfers files over SFTP, SCP, FTP (with TLS), WebDAV and Amazon S3,
      synchronizes and compares directories, keeps a remote directory up to
      date, edits remote files, and runs commands on the server.
    </p>
    <p>A WinSCP equivalent for Linux.</p>
  </description>
